    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d98">

                <pb facs="0181" n="93" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg93"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.51/810: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-11-10T12:00:00-05:00">November 10,
                        1933—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>94. Your 110, November 9, noon. We handed the Brazilian Ambassador today an
                    informal memorandum expressing our views as to the necessity of consultation
                    between the bondholders organization and the Brazilian Government.<anchor n="72"
                        xml:id="d98-f1"/> The Ambassador said he would cable his Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
